    "en": "A novella set in the Persian court of Ahasuerus (Xerxes I). The Jewish queen Esther, aided by her cousin Mordecai, foils the genocidal plot of the vizier Haman against the Jewish population of the empire. The story provides the foundation narrative for the festival of Purim."
